# Line endings are locked: repo stores LF, checkout gives LF.
# Why: the baseline manifest pins byte-level MD5. Git for Windows ships
# core.autocrlf=true at system level, so a fresh clone used to convert
# every .py/.json to CRLF (gate.py 7,313 B -> 7,520 B) and
# verify_baseline.py reported "snapshot corrupted (43 changed)".
# That was a line-ending artifact, not a code problem.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never touch (includes samples under tests/data)
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.bin binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.7z binary
*.xls binary
*.xlsx binary
*.doc binary
*.docx binary
